<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -- Arrow Financial.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -- Arrow Financial.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Albany Corp said it downgraded Arrow Financial Corp to neutral from buy to reflect the current valuation of the shares.</p>
<p>-- said trimmed the 1997 earnings estimate to $1.70 a share from $1.87 a share.</p>
<p>-- Arrow Financial closed Monday at 24-3/4.</p>
<p>-- set a 1998 earnings estimate of $1.92 a share.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
